SELECT ?item ?itemLabel (COUNT(DISTINCT(?film)) AS ?ct)  (SAMPLE(?sample) as ?sample)  WHERE { VALUES ?filmtype {wd:Q11424 wd:Q24862 wd:Q20667187 wd:Q226730} . ?film wdt:P31 ?filmtype . ?film wdt:P495 wd:Q668 . ?film wdt:P364 ?item .
OPTIONAL { ?film wdt:P577 ?d . FILTER(YEAR(?d)>(YEAR( Now() )-1))  BIND(?film as ?sample) }  SERVICE wikibase:label {bd:serviceParam wikibase:language "en"  } } GROUP BY ?item ?itemLabel ORDER BY DESC(?ct) LIMIT 12
